    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18677" root="سبح" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَبَّحٌ</span></b> , accord. to AA and the K, applied as an
epithet to a [garment of the kind called] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِسَآء</span>,
means <i>Strong:</i> and accord. to the former, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَبَّجٌ</span>,
so applied, means “ made wide. ” (TA.)

